### Retrieve Fare - Missing trips (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/fare/retrieve
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "adult_count": 1
}

###

### Retrieve Fare - Missing segments (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/fare/retrieve
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "trips": [
    {
      "trip_type": "departure",
      "airline_code": "GA",
      "trip_date": "2025-08-01",
      "segments": []
    }
  ],
  "adult_count": 1
}

