### ============================================================
### 6. VOLTRAS - PNR, TICKETING, AUTO TICKET, CANCEL
### ============================================================

### Retrieve PNR - lihat detail booking + status terbaru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/pnr/retrieve
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "pnr": "14773"
}

###

### Retrieve PNR - Missing Field (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/pnr/retrieve
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

###

### Ticketing Flight - bayar tiket langsung (debit saldo office)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/ticket
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "booking_id": 1
}

###

### Ticketing - Booking Not Found (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/ticket
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "booking_id": 99999
}

###

### Auto Ticket - buat Virtual Account untuk pembayaran customer
### Response: account_no (nomor VA) + time_limit (batas bayar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/autoticket
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "booking_id": 1,
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "send_ticket": true
}

###

### Auto Ticket - send_ticket false (VA saja, tiket tidak dikirim setelah bayar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/autoticket
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "booking_id": 1,
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "send_ticket": false
}

###

### Cancel Ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/ticket/cancel
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "booking_id": 1,
  "reason": "Perubahan jadwal penumpang"
}

###

### Cancel Ticket - Tanpa Reason
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/ticket/cancel
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "booking_id": 1
}

###

### Cancel Ticket - Sudah Cancelled (should return 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/ticket/cancel
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "booking_id": 1,
  "reason": "Test double cancel"
}

###

### Print Ticket - download file HTML atau PDF
### Content-Type response: text/html atau application/pdf (tergantung maskapai)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/print?pnr=14773
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Print Insurance - download PDF asuransi
### Hanya untuk booking dengan with_insurance = true dan sudah TICKETED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/print-insurance?pnr=14773
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Advance Retrieve - daftar semua PNR maskapai GA bulan ini
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/advance-retrieve
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "airline": "GA",
  "from_date": "2025-08-01",
  "to_date": "2025-08-31",
  "status": "ALL"
}

###

### Advance Retrieve - filter BOOKED saja
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/advance-retrieve
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "airline": "GA",
  "from_date": "2025-08-01",
  "to_date": "2025-08-31",
  "status": "BOOKED"
}

###

### Advance Retrieve - filter TICKETED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/advance-retrieve
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "airline": "JT",
  "from_date": "2025-07-01",
  "to_date": "2025-08-31",
  "status": "TICKETED"
}

